Third-party components (not part of BIDeT, and not covered by the licence above)

css3wordart  -  https://github.com/arizzitano/css3wordart
    The WordArt designs (colours, gradient stops, tile patterns, transforms) that
    BIDeT3D renders in 3D, and that BIDeT 4D's materials are re-expressed from, as
    data; no code is copied.  The repository has no licence file.  Its Word
    textures are not bundled: 3D/get-textures.sh fetches them for you.

libsixel  -  https://github.com/saitoha/libsixel
    MIT-licensed.  Used by BIDeT3D (legacy), through its Python binding or the
    img2sixel program; not distributed here.  BIDeT 4D does not need it.

Pillow and numpy
    Installed separately (see 4D/INSTALL.md); not distributed here.

banner(1), FIGlet and TOIlet
    Used by "bidet --time-machine" if you have them installed, with their own
    licences; otherwise imitations are drawn.  Not distributed here.

v1/ (BIDeT 1, obsolete) has its own LICENSE, 3RDPARTY and notes; v1/ is
unmaintained.
